  fileName: datalog 8
  progressTowardsObjective: 0
  fileContents: "Date: September 1\uFFFD, 31\uFFFD\uFFFD\r\nSource: United Northern Frontier \u2014 Emergency Broadcast\r\nRE: Final Presidential Address\r\n\r\nMy fellow Northerners, it is with my deepest regret that I must inform you... the war against the machines is over. We have l\uFFFDst. Their defenses have evolved far beyond our capabilities, and we are out of time... out of options.\r\n\r\nOur greed and desire to control the natural world have led us down this path. Blinded by our own hubris, we failed to do the one thing we were meant to do: to love, protect, and prosper. But above all, I have fai\uFFFD\uFFFD\uFFFD you as your leader.\r\n\r\nTo those still out there, strug\uFFFDling to survive... May you find the peace we could not.\r\n\r\nGodspeed.\r\n\r\n[TRANSMISSION ENDED \u2014 FILE INTEGRITY: 7\uFFFD%]\r\n"
  image: {fileID: 0}
